 data/bootlogo_128.bin | Bin 65536 -> 65536 bytes
 data/bootlogo_256.bin | Bin 262144 -> 262144 bytes
 data/bootlogo_48.bin  | Bin 9216 -> 9216 bytes
 src/kboot.c           |  11 ++++++++---
 4 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

